
---
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";

const email = "vnadealshub.official@gmail.com";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Affiliate Disclosure | VnA Deals Hub</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Learn how affiliate links work on VnA Deals Hub." />

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f7fb;
      color: #1f2937;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

   
header {
  background: #ffffff;
  padding: 18px 4.5%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 1000;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
}

.logo {
  font-size: 30px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #2563eb;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

nav {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 22px;
}

nav a {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: #374151;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 600;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

nav a:hover {
  color: #2563eb;
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  header {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  nav {
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }
}

    
.hero {
  margin: 35px 4.5%;
  padding: 85px 25px;
  min-height: 404px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  text-align: center;
  color: white;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111827, #2563eb);
  border-radius: 22px;
}


    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #dbeafe;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 45px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .content-card {
      background: white;
      padding: 35px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
    }

    .content-card h2 {
      color: #111827;
      margin: 28px 0 10px;
      font-size: 21px;
    }

    .content-card h2:first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .content-card p {
      color: #4b5563;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .highlight {
      background: #eff6ff;
      border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .highlight p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #1e40af;
    }

    .content-card a {
      color: #2563eb;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    footer {
      background: #111827;
      color: #d1d5db;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .footer-links {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      color: #d1d5db;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: white;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      header {
        justify-content: center;
      }

      nav {
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 30px;
      }

      .content-card {
        padding: 24px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<Header />

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p>Transparency matters. Here's how affiliate links work on our website.</p>
  </section>

  <main class="container">
    <div class="content-card">

      <h2>1. Our Affiliate Relationship</h2>
      <p>
        VnA Deals Hub participates in affiliate marketing programs,
        including the Amazon Associates Program. This means some links
        on our website may be affiliate links.
      </p>

      <div class="highlight">
        <p>
          As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases.
          This does not increase the price you pay.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>2. How We Earn Commissions</h2>
      <p>
        When you click an affiliate link and make an eligible purchase,
        we may receive a small commission from the retailer.
        The commission comes from the retailer, not as an additional
        charge to you.
      </p>

      <h2>3. No Extra Cost to You</h2>
      <p>
        Using our affiliate links does not add an extra fee to your
        purchase. The price and checkout process are determined by
        the retailer.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Our Product Recommendations</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to share useful product information and deals.
        Affiliate relationships do not guarantee that a product is
        suitable for every visitor. Please check product details,
        specifications, reviews and seller information before buying.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Prices and Availability</h2>
      <p>
        Product prices, offers and availability can change at any time.
        The retailer's website displays the latest information.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Third-Party Websites</h2>
      <p>
        When you click an affiliate link, you may be redirected to a
        third-party retailer. Purchases are subject to that retailer's
        terms, policies and conditions.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Questions</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about our affiliate relationships,
        contact us at
        <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Updates to This Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this page when our affiliate relationships or
        website practices change. Any updates will be published here.
      </p>

    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/about">About Us</a>
      <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>
      <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a>
    </div>

    <p>© 2026 VnA Deals Hub. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
